From 7ecf6e104cfd20dc80db1c178795c90d60701b54 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: onlyfish <linotfish@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 01:04:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] sepolicy: add hal_dms_hwservice to the compat ignore lists

hal_dms_hwservice is declared in the system_ext public policy so that
audioserver can find the Dolby DMS HAL. New public types must be listed
in every versioned compat ignore file, otherwise treble_sepolicy_tests
fails with:

  SELinux: The following public types were found added to the policy
  without an entry into the compatibility mapping file(s) ... :
  hal_dms_hwservice

Change-Id: I5b8f2c0a9d6e4b7f1c3a8e2d5b9f0c6a4e7d1b83
---
